0 1.4rem 0}.kec-card-features li{font-size:.78rem;color:#6B6355;padding:.3rem 0;border-bottom:1px solid #E0D8C8;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px}.kec-card-features li:last-child{border-bottom:none}.kec-card.featured .kec-card-features li{color:rgba(255,255,255,.8);border-color:rgba(255,255,255,.1)}.kec-card-features .tick{color:#1A6B4A;font-size:.7rem;flex-shrink:0}.kec-card.featured .kec-card-features .tick{color:#7FFFC4}.kec-card-cta{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;font-size:.78rem;font-weight:700;color:#1A3D6B;border-bottom:2px solid #E8EFF8;padding-bottom:2px;text-decoration:none;transition:all .2s}.kec-card-cta:hover{border-color:#1A3D6B}.kec-card.featured .kec-card-cta{color:#fff;border-color:rgba(255,255,255,.3)}.kec-card.featured .kec-card-cta:hover{border-color:#fff}@media(max-width:920px){.kec-svc-header{grid-template-columns:1fr}.kec-svc-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}@media(max-width:600px){.kec-svc-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}</style><div class=\"kec-svc\"><div class=\"kec-svc-header\"><div><span class=\"kec-svc-label\">What We Do</span><h2 class=\"kec-svc-title\">Complete Elder Care —<br><em>Under One Roof.</em></h2></div><div><p class=\"kec-svc-sub\">Everything your Ma-Baba needs. From one trusted team. Without leaving home — or without you needing to leave your country.</p></div></div><div class=\"kec-svc-grid\"><div class=\"kec-card\"><span class=\"kec-card-icon\">👴</span><span class=\"kec-card-tag\">CMIG Certified</span><h3 class=\"kec-card-title\">Certified Gerontologist Home Visits</h3><p class=\"kec-card-desc\">A CMIG-trained gerontologist visits your parents regularly. Weekly check-ins, safety audits, medicine coordination, and WhatsApp video updates sent directly to you.</p><ul class=\"kec-card-features\"><li><span class=\"tick\">✓</span>Weekly in-home safety audit</li><li><span class=\"tick\">✓</span>Medicine management & check</li><li><span class=\"tick\">✓</span>Dementia & arthritis monitoring</li><li><span class=\"tick\">✓</span>📲 Weekly \"Ma bhalo ache\" video to your WhatsApp</li><li><span class=\"tick\">✓</span>Emergency 1-hour response in Kolkata/Howrah</li></ul><a href=\"#pricing\" class=\"kec-card-cta\">See Plans →</a></div><div class=\"kec-card featured\"><span class=\"kec-card-icon\">📱</span><span class=\"kec-card-tag\">Most Popular</span><h3 class=\"kec-card-title\">Telemedicine Video Consultations</h3><p class=\"kec-card-desc\">Talk to a certified Bengali-speaking doctor in 10 minutes — from home. Prescription on WhatsApp. Available at 2 AM. From ₹199 only.</p><ul class=\"kec-card-features\"><li><span class=\"tick\">✓</span>Doctor in 10 minutes, 24×7</li><li><span class=\"tick\">✓</span>Digital Rx sent to WhatsApp</li><li><span class=\"tick\">✓</span>Bengali, Hindi & English</li><li><span class=\"tick\">✓</span>Medicine delivery in Howrah 2–4 hrs</li><li><span class=\"tick\">✓</span>Family Account — you book from abroad</li></ul><a href=\"#pricing\" class=\"kec-card-cta\">Book Now →</a></div><div class=\"kec-card\"><span class=\"kec-card-icon\">👨‍👩‍👧</span><span class=\"kec-card-tag\">NRI Families</span><h3 class=\"kec-card-title\">Family Care Coordination</h3><p class=\"kec-card-desc\">Living in Singapore, London, or the US? We become your local family in Kolkata. Book doctors, manage prescriptions, coordinate hospital visits — we handle everything.</p><ul class=\"kec-card-features\"><li><span class=\"tick\">✓</span>You book from anywhere in the world</li><li><span class=\"tick\">✓</span>All reports & Rx on your WhatsApp</li><li><span class=\"tick\">✓</span>Hospital escort & coordination</li><li><span class=\"tick\">✓</span>Festival & birthday companionship</li><li><span class=\"tick\">✓</span>Monthly written care report to you</li></ul><a href=\"#pricing\" class=\"kec-card-cta\">See Plans →</a></div></div></div>"
